<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 170 0 R
/T (The Simple Inventory Tracker is a Java-based application developed to manage product details efficiently. It allows users to add, display, and search for products in the inventory. It also provides sorting options based on product name and price. This project uses Java concepts such as classes, objects, ArrayList, loops, and the Collections framework to perform basic inventory management operations.)
/E (The Simple Inventory Tracker is a Java-based application developed to manage product details efficiently. It allows users to add, display, and search for products in the inventory. It also provides sorting options based on product name and price. This project uses Java concepts such as classes, objects, ArrayList, loops, and the Collections framework to perform basic inventory management operations.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
