204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 170 0 R
/T (Managing product details manually can be difficult, time-consuming, and may lead to errors in maintaining inventory records. Finding specific products and organizing product information can also be challenging. The Simple Inventory Tracker is developed using Java to overcome these problems by providing an easy way to add, display, search, and sort product details. It helps users manage inventory records accurately and efficiently.)
/E (Managing product details manually can be difficult, time-consuming, and may lead to errors in maintaining inventory records. Finding specific products and organizing product information can also be challenging. The Simple Inventory Tracker is developed using Java to overcome these problems by providing an easy way to add, display, search, and sort product details. It helps users manage inventory records accurately and efficiently.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
